<title>UK: Zeneca says FDA approves modified Diprivan.</title>
<headline>Zeneca says FDA approves modified Diprivan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zeneca Group Plc confirmed that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) had granted exclusivity of the company's modified formulation of Diprivan, an intravenous sedative.</p>
<p>It said the drug has been given exclusivity until June 11, 1999.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
